# This file is no longer required.
#
# The store URL is entered in the app (Settings -> Your store) and the dev proxy
# routes from it per request, so there is nothing to configure here and no
# server restart when you change stores.
#
# Kept as a placeholder because Vite still reads .env files, and because a
# future deployment (Mode B, the Cloudflare Worker in Appendix H) will want
# build-time config here.
